{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/antrag/layout,_N_T_/antrag/[id]/layout,_N_T_/antrag/[id]/page,_N_T_/antrag/4"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/antrag/$d$id/__PAGE__","/antrag/$d$id","/antrag","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><!--N579OrhReJmY4lbTlB1RX--><html lang=\"de\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/47fe1b7cd6e6ed85-s.p.855a563b.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/83afe278b6a6bb3c-s.p.3a6ba036.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/8e6fa89aa22d24ec-s.p.3aec397d.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/e2334d715941921e-s.p.d82a9aff.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/4ae24185855008a5.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/cbd55ab9639e1e66.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/aa0a7c5c022cbeb9.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/cc759f7c2413b7ff.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/4dd28bc3f722184a.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-492cd776fed59e0e.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/8db7249337818e60.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/ff1a16fafef87110.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/7340adf74ff47ec0.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/56d0d71c1b117ed0.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Moosburg Transparent - Verstehen, was entschieden wird</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Die digitale Plattform für transparente Stadtratsentscheidungen in Moosburg. Einfach verständlich, barrierefrei und bürgernah.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0b3bf435.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/a6dad97d9634a72d.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"inter_7a7ef1f4-module__jjo8ZG__variable poppins_f08ea3ad-module__mErFHW__variable antialiased min-h-screen flex flex-col\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header class=\"bg-[var(--primary)] text-white sticky top-0 z-50 shadow-md\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between h-16\"><a class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" href=\"/\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-[var(--primary)] font-bold text-xl\">M</span></div><div class=\"hidden sm:block\"><h1 class=\"font-bold text-lg leading-tight\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Moosburg Transparent</h1><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--secondary)] opacity-90\">Verstehen, was entschieden wird</p></div></a><nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-6\"><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"/\">Dashboard</a><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"/antraege\">Alle Anträge</a><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"/karte\">Stadtkarte</a><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"/abstimmungen\">Abstimmungen</a><a class=\"hover:text-[var(--accent)] transition-colors font-medium\" href=\"/ueber-uns\">Über uns</a></nav><button class=\"md:hidden p-2 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" aria-label=\"Menü öffnen\"><svg class=\"w-6 h-6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"min-h-screen bg-[var(--neutral-light)]\"><div class=\"bg-white border-b\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-4\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-[var(--primary)] hover:underline text-sm\" href=\"/antraege\">← Zurück zur Übersicht</a></div></div><div class=\"py-12\" style=\"background-color:#0077B615\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mb-4\"><span class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-xl\" style=\"background-color:#0077B630\">🚗</span><span class=\"text-sm font-medium\" style=\"color:#0077B6\">Verkehr</span><span class=\"badge badge-danger\">❌<!-- --> <!-- -->Abgelehnt</span></div><h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[var(--neutral-dark)] mb-4\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Erhöhung der Parkgebühren in der Innenstadt</h1><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\"><span>📅 <!-- -->18. Oktober 2024</span><span>🏛️ <!-- -->Stadtratssitzung Oktober 2024</span><span>📍 <!-- -->Innenstadt</span></div></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-2 space-y-8\"><div class=\"card p-6\"><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-3\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">📝 Kurz erklärt</h2><p class=\"text-[var(--neutral-dark)] leading-relaxed bg-[var(--secondary)] p-4 rounded-lg\">Die Parkgebühren in der Innenstadt sollen von 1€ auf 1,50€ pro Stunde erhöht werden.</p></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-4\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">📄 Details zum Antrag</h2><div class=\"prose prose-sm max-w-none text-[var(--neutral-dark)]\"><p class=\"mb-3\">Um den Parkraum in der Innenstadt besser zu bewirtschaften und Anreize für den Umstieg auf ÖPNV und Fahrrad zu schaffen, sollen die Parkgebühren angepasst werden.</p><p class=\"mb-3\">**Was ändert sich?**\n- Parkgebühr steigt von 1,00€ auf 1,50€ pro Stunde\n- Erste halbe Stunde bleibt kostenlos (für kurze Besorgungen)\n- Neue Fahrradstellplätze werden geschaffen\n- Busverbindungen in die Innenstadt werden verbessert</p><p class=\"mb-3\">**Warum ist das wichtig?**\n- Mehr Parkplatzumschlag = mehr Verfügbarkeit für Kurzzeitparker\n- Einnahmen finanzieren besseren ÖPNV\n- Weniger Verkehr in der Innenstadt\n- Attraktivere Innenstadt für Fußgänger</p><p class=\"mb-3\">**Was bringt das ein?**\nErwartete Mehreinnahmen: ca. 120.000€ pro Jahr\nVerwendung: 100% für ÖPNV-Verbesserung</p></div></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><h2 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-4\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">⏱️ Zeitverlauf</h2><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"absolute left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-0.5 bg-gray-200\"></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 relative\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center z-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--primary)] text-white\">✓</div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"font-medium text-sm\">Antrag von Grünen-Fraktion eingereicht</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">01. August 2024</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 relative\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center z-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--primary)] text-white\">✓</div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"font-medium text-sm\">Kontroverse Diskussion im Verkehrsausschuss</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">10. September 2024</p></div></div><div class=\"flex gap-4 relative\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center z-10 flex-shrink-0 bg-[var(--primary)] text-white\">✓</div><div class=\"\"><p class=\"font-medium text-sm\">Abstimmung im Stadtrat - Abgelehnt</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">18. Oktober 2024</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-4\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">💬 Bürgermeinungen (<!-- -->2<!-- -->)</h3><form class=\"mb-6 p-4 bg-[var(--neutral-light)] rounded-lg\"><h4 class=\"font-medium text-sm mb-3\">Deine Meinung zählt!</h4><div class=\"mb-3\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Dein Name\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--primary)] focus:border-transparent\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></div><div class=\"mb-3\"><textarea placeholder=\"Was denkst du zu diesem Antrag?\" rows=\"3\" class=\"w-full px-4 py-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[var(--primary)] focus:border-transparent resize-none\" required=\"\"></textarea></div><button type=\"submit\" disabled=\"\" class=\"btn-primary disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed\">Kommentar abschicken</button></form><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"p-4 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-[var(--primary)] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium\">E</div><div><p class=\"font-medium text-sm\">Einzelhändler M.</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">19.10.2024</p></div></div><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] hover:text-[var(--primary)] transition-colors\">❤️ <!-- -->34</button></div><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-dark)] leading-relaxed\">Gut, dass das abgelehnt wurde. Höhere Parkgebühren hätten noch mehr Kunden zu den großen Einkaufszentren getrieben.</p></div><div class=\"p-4 bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-lg\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-[var(--primary)] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium\">R</div><div><p class=\"font-medium text-sm\">Radfahrer2024</p><p class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)]\">19.10.2024</p></div></div><button class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] hover:text-[var(--primary)] transition-colors\">❤️ <!-- -->21</button></div><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-dark)] leading-relaxed\">Schade, ich hätte mir gewünscht, dass die Einnahmen wirklich in bessere Radwege fließen.</p></div></div></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6\"><div class=\"card p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-4\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">📊 Abstimmungsergebnis</h3><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"h-8 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium transition-all\" style=\"width:30.76923076923077%\">31%</div><div class=\"h-full bg-gray-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium transition-all\" style=\"width:7.6923076923076925%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-sm font-medium transition-all\" style=\"width:61.53846153846154%\">62%</div></div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded bg-[var(--success)]\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Dafür: <strong>8</strong></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded bg-gray-400\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Enthaltung: <strong>2</strong></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded bg-[var(--danger)]\"></div><span class=\"text-sm\">Dagegen: <strong>16</strong></span></div></div><h4 class=\"font-medium text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-3\">Abstimmung nach Fraktion</h4><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:#0088CC\"></div><span class=\"w-16 text-sm font-medium\">CSU</span><div class=\"flex-1 h-6 bg-gray-100 rounded overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] transition-all\" style=\"width:18.181818181818183%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-gray-400 transition-all\" style=\"width:9.090909090909092%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] transition-all\" style=\"width:72.72727272727273%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] w-20 text-right\">2<!-- -->:<!-- -->1<!-- -->:<!-- -->8</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:#E3000F\"></div><span class=\"w-16 text-sm font-medium\">SPD</span><div class=\"flex-1 h-6 bg-gray-100 rounded overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] transition-all\" style=\"width:40%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-gray-400 transition-all\" style=\"width:0%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] transition-all\" style=\"width:60%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] w-20 text-right\">2<!-- -->:<!-- -->0<!-- -->:<!-- -->3</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:#46962B\"></div><span class=\"w-16 text-sm font-medium\">Grüne</span><div class=\"flex-1 h-6 bg-gray-100 rounded overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] transition-all\" style=\"width:100%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-gray-400 transition-all\" style=\"width:0%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] transition-all\" style=\"width:0%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] w-20 text-right\">4<!-- -->:<!-- -->0<!-- -->:<!-- -->0</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:#FF8800\"></div><span class=\"w-16 text-sm font-medium\">FW</span><div class=\"flex-1 h-6 bg-gray-100 rounded overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] transition-all\" style=\"width:0%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-gray-400 transition-all\" style=\"width:20%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] transition-all\" style=\"width:80%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] w-20 text-right\">0<!-- -->:<!-- -->1<!-- -->:<!-- -->4</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full flex-shrink-0\" style=\"background-color:#FFED00\"></div><span class=\"w-16 text-sm font-medium\">FDP</span><div class=\"flex-1 h-6 bg-gray-100 rounded overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] transition-all\" style=\"width:0%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-gray-400 transition-all\" style=\"width:0%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] transition-all\" style=\"width:100%\"></div></div><span class=\"text-xs text-[var(--neutral-gray)] w-20 text-right\">0<!-- -->:<!-- -->0<!-- -->:<!-- -->1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-2\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">🗳️ Wie würdest du abstimmen?</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4\">Diese symbolische Abstimmung zeigt die Meinung der Bürger:innen.<!-- --> Klicke, um deine Stimme abzugeben!</p><div class=\"flex gap-3 mb-4\"><button class=\"flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-[var(--success)]/10 text-[var(--success)] hover:bg-[var(--success)] hover:text-white\">👍 Dafür</button><button class=\"flex-1 py-3 px-4 rounded-lg font-medium transition-all bg-[var(--danger)]/10 text-[var(--danger)] hover:bg-[var(--danger)] hover:text-white\">👎 Dagegen</button></div><div class=\"mb-2\"><div class=\"h-4 bg-gray-200 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex\"><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--success)] transition-all duration-500\" style=\"width:31.01851851851852%\"></div><div class=\"h-full bg-[var(--danger)] transition-all duration-500\" style=\"width:68.98148148148148%\"></div></div></div><div class=\"flex justify-between text-sm\"><span class=\"text-[var(--success)] font-medium\">134<!-- --> Stimmen (<!-- -->31<!-- -->%)</span><span class=\"text-[var(--danger)] font-medium\">298<!-- --> Stimmen (<!-- -->69<!-- -->%)</span></div></div><div class=\"card p-6\"><h3 class=\"font-semibold text-lg mb-3\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">📤 Teilen</h3><p class=\"text-sm text-[var(--neutral-gray)] mb-4\">Mach andere Bürger:innen auf diesen Antrag aufmerksam!</p><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><button class=\"flex-1 py-2 px-4 bg-[#1DA1F2] text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">Twitter</button><button class=\"flex-1 py-2 px-4 bg-[#4267B2] text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">Facebook</button><button class=\"flex-1 py-2 px-4 bg-[#25D366] text-white rounded-lg text-sm font-medium hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity\">WhatsApp</button></div></div></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"bg-[var(--neutral-dark)] text-white mt-auto\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8\"><div class=\"md:col-span-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-[var(--primary)] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-white font-bold text-xl\">M</span></div><h2 class=\"font-bold text-lg\" style=\"font-family:Poppins, sans-serif\">Moosburg Transparent</h2></div><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Eine Initiative für mehr Transparenz in der Kommunalpolitik. Wir machen Stadtratsentscheidungen verständlich und zugänglich für alle Bürger:innen.</p><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-xs mt-4\">Ein Projekt im Rahmen des Service Design Studiums an der Hochschule München.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-[var(--accent)]\">Navigation</h3><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/\">Dashboard</a></li><li><a class=\"text-gray-400 hover:te